<title>LATVIA: TALSI FORESTRY BOOSTS CAPITAL BY 236,000 LATS.</title>
<headline>TALSI FORESTRY BOOSTS CAPITAL BY 236,000 LATS.</headline>
<dateline>RIGA 1997-04-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Secondary list company Talsi Forestry has decided to boost its capital, the stock exchange said on Thursday.</p>
<p>The company decided at a shareholder meeting to boost the capital by 236,290 lats by capitalising its tax debts. It did not say what the new share capital level was.</p>
<p>-- Riga Newsroom, +371 721 5240</p>
</text>
